{
 "schema": 1,
 "title": "Ninety Seconds",
 "seed": 41,
 "timing": {
  "lead_in": 1.2,
  "tail": 2.4
 },
 "narration": [
  {
   "id": "l1",
   "text": "At closing time, the city lowers its eyelids, and the vault begins to breathe.",
   "duration": 5.212,
   "gap_after": 0.7,
   "audio": "vo/l1.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2",
   "text": "Behind the counter, a clock gives the crew exactly ninety seconds.",
   "duration": 4.64,
   "gap_after": 0.6,
   "audio": "vo/l2.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3",
   "text": "No faces are needed; only gloves, metal, and the patience of machines.",
   "duration": 4.549,
   "gap_after": 0.6,
   "audio": "vo/l3.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l4",
   "text": "The vault door turns, slow as a planet, then gives way.",
   "duration": 3.426,
   "gap_after": 0.8,
   "audio": "vo/l4.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l5",
   "text": "Inside, money sits in obedient stacks, waiting to become weather.",
   "duration": 4.353,
   "gap_after": 0.6,
   "audio": "vo/l5.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l6",
   "text": "The alarm does not scream; it blooms, red and silent, across glass.",
   "duration": 4.56,
   "gap_after": 0.5,
   "audio": "vo/l6.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l7",
   "text": "A camera watches the first runner cross marble towards the night.",
   "duration": 4.419,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l8",
   "text": "Outside, rain needles the windscreen of a waiting black car.",
   "duration": 4.169,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l8.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l9",
   "text": "The driver touches the wheel, and the street folds open.",
   "duration": 3.88,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l9.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "text": "Tyres bite water; headlights split traffic into silver animals.",
   "duration": 4.282,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l10.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "text": "Behind them, police lights gather, blue and red, like weather forming.",
   "duration": 4.68,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l11.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "text": "Above the avenue, a helicopter holds the chase in its cold eye.",
   "duration": 4.057,
   "gap_after": 0.5,
   "audio": "vo/l12.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "text": "They take the tunnel because tunnels forgive speed and hide direction.",
   "duration": 4.871,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l13.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "text": "For twenty seconds, the city becomes concrete, echo, and white lines.",
   "duration": 4.565,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l14.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "text": "At the bridge, the river appears underneath, black and suddenly wide.",
   "duration": 4.725,
   "gap_after": 0.5,
   "audio": "vo/l15.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l16",
   "text": "One police car slides sideways, harmlessly, scattering rain across headlights.",
   "duration": 5.64,
   "gap_after": 0.6,
   "audio": "vo/l16.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l17",
   "text": "The briefcase on the back seat remains perfectly still.",
   "duration": 3.663,
   "gap_after": 0.4,
   "audio": "vo/l17.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l18",
   "text": "That is the oddity: panic everywhere, and the case behaves like ballast.",
   "duration": 4.701,
   "gap_after": 0.6,
   "audio": "vo/l18.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l19",
   "text": "A phone screen lights once, showing a simple message: now.",
   "duration": 4.0,
   "gap_after": 0.7,
   "audio": "vo/l19.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l20",
   "text": "The getaway car does not turn towards the motorway; it descends.",
   "duration": 4.178,
   "gap_after": 0.5,
   "audio": "vo/l20.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l21",
   "text": "Down in the car park, engines fade, footsteps continue, measured and dry.",
   "duration": 4.842,
   "gap_after": 0.6,
   "audio": "vo/l21.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l22",
   "text": "They leave the money beside a pillar, as if returning lost property.",
   "duration": 4.72,
   "gap_after": 0.7,
   "audio": "vo/l22.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l23",
   "text": "By dawn, police surround an empty road, counting what was never stolen.",
   "duration": 4.637,
   "gap_after": 0.8,
   "audio": "vo/l23.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l24",
   "text": "The vault is open, the notes remain, and the records are gone.",
   "duration": 4.2,
   "gap_after": 0.8,
   "audio": "vo/l24.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l25",
   "text": "Ninety seconds was not the robbery. It was the distraction.",
   "duration": 4.481,
   "gap_after": 0.9,
   "audio": "vo/l25.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "l26",
   "text": "Somewhere beyond the city, a train carries silence into the morning.",
   "duration": 4.8,
   "gap_after": 0.9,
   "audio": "vo/l26.wav"
  }
 ],
